Subject: Default Valkey and exporter flags to DHI images
Origin: DHI-internal (default image redirection)
Description: Set the operator's default Valkey and metrics-exporter flag values
 to tracked DHI images. Explicit command-line flags continue to override these
 defaults, while deployments that omit the flags retain hardened sidecars.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/valkey-io/valkey-operator.git 9b1dd57d9f0ab4583c6fedd3475c982d556c62ed
Verify: cmd `grep -qF "$VALKEY_REFERENCE" cmd/main.go && grep -qF "$REDIS_EXPORTER_REFERENCE" cmd/main.go && echo DHI-defaults-present` expect "DHI-defaults-present"
Forwarded: not-needed (DHI packages require hardened default sidecar images)
Drop-When: never: DHI packages must retain hardened Valkey and exporter defaults

--- a/cmd/main.go
+++ b/cmd/main.go
@@ -330 +330 @@ func imageFlags(fs *flag.FlagSet) {
-	fs.StringVar(&controller.DefaultImage, "default-valkey-image", "",
+	fs.StringVar(&controller.DefaultImage, "default-valkey-image", "${VALKEY_REFERENCE}",
@@ -332 +332 @@ func imageFlags(fs *flag.FlagSet) {
-	fs.StringVar(&controller.DefaultExporterImage, "default-exporter-image", "",
+	fs.StringVar(&controller.DefaultExporterImage, "default-exporter-image", "${REDIS_EXPORTER_REFERENCE}",
